{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the dangerous frontiers of 18th-century China in this action-packed pixel-art adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deflection-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat of <i>False Princess Iruruu</i> revolves around the risks and rewards of deflection. Guard right before an attack and you will deflect it, redirecting damage onto the enemies' poise. Guard too late or too early, and you risk taking damage to your poise and health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/fb0fa5d7e446ee4f0f3c94c8e6a17c38.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/fb0fa5d7e446ee4f0f3c94c8e6a17c38.webm?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/fb0fa5d7e446ee4f0f3c94c8e6a17c38.mp4?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Attacks &amp; Counters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, not everything can be deflected. Certain attacks require special responses. Hooks, grabs, shockwaves, and other forms of unique attacks have to be dealt with using specific moves and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/23b2f2b02c4cd733e9b16ed3c5188be2.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/23b2f2b02c4cd733e9b16ed3c5188be2.webm?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/23b2f2b02c4cd733e9b16ed3c5188be2.mp4?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choosing mercy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat encounters with foes can also end non-lethally. When an enemy's poise is broken, a sword attack will instantly kill them. However, deflecting an attack from an enemy in this vulnerable state will disarm them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may choose the path of mercy, but be aware that your enemies won't always return the favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d964f7ce03a42db5cae62afe759b960c.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d964f7ce03a42db5cae62afe759b960c.webm?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d964f7ce03a42db5cae62afe759b960c.mp4?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A tale of ambition, corruption, and falsehoods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 18th-century China, the story follows a nomad girl named Iruruu as she receives an urgent summons to become an imperial consort. Shortly into her journey, the imperial seal\u2014her only mark of legitimacy\u2014was stolen. Still determined to become an official consort, Iruruu journeys onward as she finds herself embroiled in a larger political conflict, a result of lasting tension from past wars and imperial decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/36df033a13166f021fb9f22dd536dd67.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" width=640 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/36df033a13166f021fb9f22dd536dd67.webm?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/36df033a13166f021fb9f22dd536dd67.mp4?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704290?t=1766062781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704290?t=1766062781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/5d458dc74848729d0b307ab577ab33ab50530e38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766062781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/5d458dc74848729d0b307ab577ab33ab50530e38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766062781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the dangerous frontiers of 18th-century China in this action-packed pixel-art adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deflection-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat of <i>False Princess Iruruu</i> revolves around the risks and rewards of deflection. Guard right before an attack and you will deflect it, redirecting damage onto the enemies' poise. Guard too late or too early, and you risk taking damage to your poise and health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/fb0fa5d7e446ee4f0f3c94c8e6a17c38.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/fb0fa5d7e446ee4f0f3c94c8e6a17c38.webm?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/fb0fa5d7e446ee4f0f3c94c8e6a17c38.mp4?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Attacks &amp; Counters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, not everything can be deflected. Certain attacks require special responses. Hooks, grabs, shockwaves, and other forms of unique attacks have to be dealt with using specific moves and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/23b2f2b02c4cd733e9b16ed3c5188be2.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/23b2f2b02c4cd733e9b16ed3c5188be2.webm?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/23b2f2b02c4cd733e9b16ed3c5188be2.mp4?t=1766062781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choosing mercy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat encounters with foes can also end non-lethally. When an enemy's poise is broken, a sword attack will instantly kill them. However, deflecting an attack from an enemy in this vulnerable state will disarm them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may choose the path of mercy, but be aware that your enemies won't always return the favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d964f7ce03a42db5cae62afe759b960c.poster.avif?t=1766062781\" wid